<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>Unusual Activity Detected</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: #f5f5f5; padding: 20px; }
    .container { max-width: 480px; margin: 0 auto; background: #fff; padding: 32px; border-radius: 8px; }
    .code { font-size: 32px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 4px; text-align: center; margin: 24px 0; color: #111; }
    .footer { font-size: 12px; color: #888; margin-top: 24px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Unusual Activity Detected</h2>
    <p>We noticed a login attempt from an unrecognized device or location. To keep your account secure, please verify this attempt.</p>
    <p>Your verification code is:</p>
    <div class="code">{{code}}</div>
    <p>This code will expire in 10 minutes.</p>
    <p>If this wasn't you, we recommend changing your password immediately.</p>
    <div class="footer">
      <p>Sent by {{appName}}</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
